WEBVTT

00:26:26.871 --> 00:26:31.538
I will say that it's something that
I loved the possibility of it and

00:26:31.538 --> 00:26:34.746
the promise of it. And it
was one of, you know,

00:26:34.746 --> 00:26:39.954
so many things that we were rethinking and
trying to find ways to sort of fit

00:26:40.329 --> 00:26:42.454
the pieces of the puzzle together.

00:26:42.496 --> 00:26:44.038
And I know that for some people,

00:26:44.038 --> 00:26:48.829
it they clicked in and it worked
and was fun and surprising.

00:26:49.038 --> 00:26:51.121
And for other people it was, you know,

00:26:51.246 --> 00:26:55.871
understandably infuriating and sacrilege
and stupid and wrong.

00:26:56.079 --> 00:27:00.496
The reactions were were vast, but it was
also something that was, you know,